# {{name}}

An orbic service made by `hyve init --template orbic-service`.

```sh
hyve dev    # runs the server with a local database; saving a file restarts it
hyve test   # the tests, on an in-memory database
curl -X POST localhost:3000/v1/notes -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{"body":"hello"}'
curl localhost:3000/v1/notes
```

Tables are created by the `.sql` files in `migrations/`, applied in name
order. `hyve dev` runs orbic's tool, `hyve-orbic`:
`cargo install orbic-cli --version ={{orbic}}`.
